    "enUS": {
      "description": "Here ya go, champ. One drink for ol' grumpy guts over there. If this doesn't sober him up, nothin' will.\r\n\r\nOh and uh... wash your hands after touchin' this. And don't get it in your eyes.",
      "summary": "Deliver Zizplink's Frothing Mug to Gray Dawnbright in Powderfuse Port.",
      "title": "Drink Up!",
